; @kozy-dozy/* are installed from GitHub Packages (private to the kozy-dozy account).
; The token is read from the environment — never commit a literal token here.
; Local dev: export NODE_AUTH_TOKEN=<classic PAT with read:packages>
; Vercel:    set NODE_AUTH_TOKEN as an Environment Variable (Production/Preview/Development).
; NOTE: yarn 1 hard-fails if NODE_AUTH_TOKEN is unset, so it must always be exported.
@kozy-dozy:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
